  "reference": "2 Korinto 4",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero, kubera ko Imana mu buntu bwayo yatwizigije iki gikorwa, imitima yacu nticika intege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko twahevye ibiterasoni vyose twakora twinyegeje; ntidukoresha ubugunge, ntitugoramika ijambo ry’Imana. Ahubwo tuvugira ukuri ahabona, kugira ngo abantu bamenye abo turi imbere y’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimba Ubutumwa Bwiza tuvuga budatahuritse, ni ku bariko baraja mu mahonero bonyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami w’iyi si yarahumishije ubwenge bw’abatizera, kugira ngo ntibabone umuco w’Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’ubwiza bwa Kristo, we shusho y’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko iyo tuvuga ubutumwa, ntitwivuga twebwe nyene. Ariko twigisha ko Yesu ari Umwami, natwe tukaba abakozi banyu ku bwa Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana yavuze iti: “Ahari umwijima nihabe umuco,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Itanguriro 1:3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yatumye umuco wayo ukayangana mu mitima yacu kugira ngo turonke ugutahura ivy’ubwiza bw’Imana bukayanganira kuri Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko twebwe ubwacu tumeze nk’udukono tumeneka turimwo ubwo butunzi buhebuje. Ni co cerekana ko ubushobozi buhambaye bukorera muri twebwe buva ku Mana, atari kuri twebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dushikirwa n’ingorane z’ubwoko bwose, ariko turi bazima. Turakehanirwa ariko ntiducika intege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turahamwa ariko ntituva ku Mana. Dukubitwa hasi ariko ntidupfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mibabaro yacu, imibiri yacu isangira urupfu na Yesu kugira ngo ubuzima bwiwe bubonekere mu mibiri yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’aho turi bazima, twama duhakwa kwicwa ku bwa Yesu, kugira ngo ubuzima bwiwe bubonekere mu mibiri yacu ipfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ukuvuga ko urupfu rukorera muri twebwe, kugira ngo ubugingo bukorere muri mwebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko twamizako tuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, kuko turi muri Mpwemu umwe n’umwanditsi wa Zaburi yavuze ati: “Nabanje kwizera, ari na yo mpamvu navuze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zaburi 116:10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turazi ko Imana yazuye Yesu mu bapfuye izotuzurana na we, itwerekane hamwe namwe imbere yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imibabaro yose ducamwo ni ku bwanyu, kugira ngo ubuntu bw’Imana buriko burashikira benshi butume amashimwe asesekara, maze Imana ihabwe icubahiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma tudacika intege, naho imibiri yacu iriko irashira, umuntu wacu w’imbere aguma yiyubura ku musi ku musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko imibabaro yacu naho ari mito kandi y’akanya gato, ituzanira ubwiza bw’akaburarugero kandi buzokwamaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ntiduhanga amaso ku biboneka vy’ab’iki gihe, ariko tuyahanga ku bitaboneka, kuko ibiboneka ari ivy’akanya gato, ariko ibitaboneka bizokwamaho ibihe vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
